From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 15:27:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a console banner and the console style to tessera.yml

The server prints a logo and a few lines about the build, Java and the machine to the console at startup. The logo, the lines and their colors come from console.banner in tessera.yml, so a server can brand its console with its own ASCII art; & color codes and {brand} {version} {minecraft} {java} {os} {cpus} {memory} placeholders work in both. The banner logger is printed without the time and level in the console. console.style sets the console log style next to the JVM flag and the environment variable, which still take precedence. tessera.yml is now loaded before the startup messages instead of when plugins are initialized.

diff --git a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/PaperBootstrap.java b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/PaperBootstrap.java
index 5d24f049fa88ed619c7793cf57525aca641a6df7..415a2f16e8a6d275ff78f9e5032e97e8911ded50 100644
